# Deployment
# The real .env holds the pinned image tag and digest for one host; only
# .env.example is committed. dev-data/ is the throwaway database
# compose.dev.yaml mounts, and compose.override.yaml is the file compose
# auto-loads -- it must never be committed, or a development configuration
# could become the running deployment without anybody choosing it.
.env
.env.previous
.env.failed
compose.override.yaml
dev-data/
